{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"CLSA-2026-1793303481","published":"2026-10-29T19:51:33Z","modified":"2026-11-20T10:17:09.618924375Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-115557"],"summary":"Fix CVE(s): CVE-2026-115557","details":"   * SECURITY UPDATE: certificate chains through compromised eMudhra\n     intermediate CA keys are accepted by the ssl module\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-115557.patch: install a verify callback on\n       every SSLContext that rejects any certificate whose public key\n       (SHA-256 of the SubjectPublicKeyInfo) is on a built-in denylist of the\n       compromised eMudhra intermediate CA keys, in Modules/_ssl.c and the new\n       Modules/_ssl/distrusted_spki.h, so such chains fail verification even\n       while the system trust store still has the root; adds the upstream\n       regression test to Lib/test/test_ssl.py.\n     - CVE-2026-115557","affected":[{"package":{"name":"idle-python3.5","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Ubuntu:16.04","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/idle-python3.5?distro=ubuntu-16.04"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1:3.5.2-2ubuntu0~16.04.13+tuxcare.els33"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/ubuntu16.04els/CLSA-2026-1793303481.json"}},{"package":{"name":"libpython3.5","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Ubuntu:16.04","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/libpython3.5?distro=ubuntu-16.04"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1:3.5.2-2ubuntu0~16.04.13+tuxcare.els33"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/ubuntu16.04els/CLSA-2026-1793303481.json"}},{"package":{"name":"libpython3.5-dev","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Ubuntu:16.04","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/libpython3.5-dev?distro=ubuntu-16.04"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1:3.5.2-2ubuntu0~16.04.13+tuxcare.els33"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/ubu